# Machine-local MCP server configs. They carry per-machine credentials
# (e.g. PLAYWRIGHT_MCP_EXTENSION_TOKEN) and absolute local paths, so they
# must never enter this public repository. Skills and subagents under
# `.agents/` stay tracked; only the `servers` leaf is local-only.
